Package: speedtester
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Edson Angelo Carara <ecarara@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), iperf3
Description: SpeedTester broadband measurement client
 SpeedTester schedules broadband measurements, persists results and provides
 a local dashboard. The package installs a user-level launcher and services.
